&_nc_oc=AdpgIqwRqtmHBbwlFBGjXfYLg_7YWuDm76JHSdGhaf0e-cuC7pcvDEuRVKc15AsFnj0&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-qro1-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQHzuCcZVJ1C64OkO1l8WsLWNUZ22rpKkqU8DP8aW-Rzxw&oe=6A97247E"}, {"file_name": "FS_Screenshot-3.png", "id": "1157916768541329", "uri": "https://scontent-qro1-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/57566684_1157916771874662_3154846063092592377_n.png?_nc_cat=101&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=7vlAkiZwuPUQ7kNvwFja74O&_nc_oc=Adq6eRQKpLiv8VmHz-KiytzEY8JHqZY4Yzc0B2tcbn-DRsS2tWhqiDoPS_RGzuFU6Vo&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-qro1-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQH9r2Yju2Nejeh0EaqAgAQCuhpxdFDuzxz1I5X1UciiAw&oe=6A97357C"}, {"file_name": "Flipside-Meta_Screenshot-4.png", "id": "503354952327839", "uri": "https://scontent-qro1-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473394163_503354955661172_3675385292904393650_n.png?_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=7PJvl2uxYgoQ7kNvwGID7Gp&_nc_oc=AdpwKU-FdFzMuccVNdaE-CfbvXHhAm72N0bz27z4HfceeHguKZKqj02x0VN8KfEg8wM&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-qro1-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQH9C_A0WvNHt_-GtcDtzW7Q1fnnUzJk5rtACCLLWN3c5g&oe=6A971BC7"}, {"file_name": "FS_Screenshot-5.png", "id": "377927191539358", "uri": "https://scontent-qro3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39035465_377927194872691_2692247835418631299_n.png?_nc_cat=106&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=KngSyUoFlgcQ7kNvwHbZZVv&_nc_oc=Adr0yDGE05XIlrkOB-qE7EBaIEZQ9ezKGFQHF045kMDx-4OcObfi9HGU2uxcpInXbGc&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-qro3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQFah2FO-WmvU28Mpaq-lhfoiypzw6g-G9DXaAebky4cqA&oe=6A973FD5"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "FS_Cover-Landscape.png", "id": "948055656716612", "uri": "https://scontent-qro1-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39001731_948055660049945_3697445677810051434_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=VFT2jONqiNwQ7kNvwFhpPEr&_nc_oc=Adot5D5NpNsLCXBG45GtU_RpIqoWDDoOtDjlmwTNYCZgRF6SNqeLQUfN40ub_NzIyyo&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-qro1-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQE1H9CDJsg9eO2wOGGMTAkhNYH3goyu1EUCitXabT9ldA&oe=6A974C64"}, "display_name": "Flipside", "keywords": ["animation", "mocap", "recording", "metaverse", "social"], "long_description": "Flipside is the metaverse social media platform for next-gen creators and their fans.\n\nWatch a steady stream of spatial content, which you can like, subscribe, share, and even remix. Connect with friends over multiplayer and watch together!\n\nNext-gen creators make spatial recordings using Flipside\u2019s built-in virtual TV studio, then share them to your channel and build a fanbase of subscribers.\n\n# Highlights:\n\n- Browse, watch, like, share and subscribe to other Flipside creators\n- Remix other creators' posts, where you can replace characters with yourself\n- Send direct messages to connect with your friends and share content\n- Record full 3D spatial recordings, including motion capture, voice, props, music and more\n- An ever-growing catalog of built-in characters, props and sets\n- Generate custom characters with built-in Ready Player Me integration\n- Generate teleprompter scripts and custom sets using AI tools\n- Show tools including cameras, camera switcher, teleprompters, slideshow, and more\n- Audio controller to add music and special effects, including a built-in audio library or import your own\n- Use our companion Flipside Broadcaster app for PC to capture 2D content for other social platforms\n- Use our Flipside Creator Tools plugin for Unity to import your own custom characters, props, and sets\n- And too many features to list them all\n\nDownload Flipside today!", "short_description": "Flipside is the metaverse social media platform for next-gen creators and their fans.\n\nWatch a steady stream of spatial content, which you can like, subscribe, share, and even remix. Connect with friends over multiplayer and watch together!\n\nNext-gen creators make spatial recordings using Flipside\u2019s built-in virtual TV studio, then share them to your channel and build a fanbase of subscribers.